invariant: INV-26
file: srv_resume.c
catches: test/lint-quic-surface.sh
reason: srv_resume.c includes aes_traffic_key.h, the one header that gives
  the traffic key a body, so the file that selects a ticket could expand
  ticket_key itself on a path nobody reviewed. srv_ticket.c is the fifth
  file the header names, and tools/quic-footprint.py fails on a sixth.

--- old
#include "widemul.h"
--- new
#include "widemul.h"
#include "aes_traffic_key.h"
